<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Activation-Informed Pareto-Guided Low-Rank Compression for Efficient LLM/VLM</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Ryan Solgi
